{
  "_comment": "The coupled chain of wh_coupled_chain.json driven by a 25 Hz camera for one second: yolo and nav at 40 ms periods (25 / 25 instances), control at 10 ms (100). The rate the global schedule is measured to sustain, so both runtimes can be shown over the same frames of the same camera.",
